核验 9313e4c7-a090-433a-9ca9-5d1c4c36ffac / v4：对应本次当前结果\n\n4. \"LOCAL_SYNTHETIC_RECEIPT_ACKNOWLEDGEMENT\"：当前约定本地产物已核验 / LOCAL_OUTPUT_VERIFIED\n未满足/阻塞原因：原结果未列阻塞；仍以当前状态为准\n下一步：原结果未要求下一步\n原核验 6535b369-1a7f-494f-825d-1a175ebd3ab5 / v5：对应本次当前结果\n\n5. \"LOCAL_CASE_RECORD_RECHECK\"：等待实际产物或当前有效来源 / WAITING_OUTPUT\n未满足/阻塞原因：CURRENT_LOCAL_CASE_REVALIDATION_REQUIRED；CURRENT_LOCAL_REVALIDATE_EVENT_PROOF_REQUIRED\n下一步：USE_ORIGINAL_ADAPTER_TO_RECHECK\n\n资格：NOT_EVALUATED；外部受理：NOT_SUBMITTED；线下履约：NO_EVIDENCE；Case目标未完成。\n原采用来源和旧计划只作为历史引用；当前所有目标均在上方保留。\n原行/原来源指纹引用原接口完整投影；导出的白名单子对象不用于重算这些原指纹。下方整包核对数据指纹可按JSON规范化重算。\n核对数据 SHA256：d804258550dfe74e0124628b3036cbb0a6dca5e71d7ec9d8083773264bc3de56\n核对数据（UTF-8 JSON，原文按JSON转义；不包含读取凭据）：\n{\n  \"actor_id\": \"ordinary-demo-enterprise\",\n  \"preparation_id\": \"21afbf6f-361b-4324-8378-cd3be8e60a63\",\n  \"case_id\": \"3c2ab02c-f76e-488a-b4fe-a3e5fc850fc4\",\n  \"run_id\": \"7891a54e-3bcd-4915-aecd-354ea9a464cc\",\n  \"preparation_revision\": 6,\n  \"request_revision\": 2,\n  \"current_request\": \"SYNTHETIC 安装包本地批准事项0 独立新诉求；全部虚构\",\n  \"original_request\": \"SYNTHETIC 安装包本地批准事项0\",\n  \"plan_id\": \"a091a6fd-374a-44e9-b709-2da7c1d0b201\",\n  \"plan_revision\": 5,\n  \"state\": \"UNVERIFIED\",\n  \"read_only\": true,\n  \"automatically_verified\": false,\n  \"case_goal_completed\": false,\n  \"qualification\": \"NOT_EVALUATED\",\n  \"external_acceptance\": \"NOT_SUBMITTED\",\n  \"offline_fulfillment\": \"NO_EVIDENCE\",\n  \"scope\": \"SYNTHETIC_CASE_RECORD_PACK_V1\",\n  \"source_scope\": \"SYNTHETIC_ADOPTED_LOCAL_GOAL_RESULTS_ONLY\",\n  \"current_required_goals\": [\n    \"LOCAL_MATERIAL_PREPARATION\",\n    \"LOCAL_CASE_RESOURCE_ASSOCIATION\",\n    \"LOCAL_INTERNAL_ACCEPTANCE\",\n    \"LOCAL_SYNTHETIC_RECEIPT_ACKNOWLEDGEMENT\",\n    \"LOCAL_CASE_RECORD_RECHECK\"\n  ],\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"goal\": \"LOCAL_MATERIAL_PREPARATION\",\n      \"title\": \"当前材料的人工核对与企业确认\",\n      \"adapter_id\": \"P1\",\n      \"step_id\": \"e5f0e2c2-6c50-4c07-